From 631102de3251589fc8282df5d85e9e2c761c2ade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Cheng <chengyuejia@foxmail.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 05:24:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kv-cache): wire INT4 backend for allocation and cache
 decode KV tokens

- Wire AscendInt4AttentionBackend in kv_int4 create_weights so the model
  runner sizes KV blocks with the packed head_size//2+4 layout instead of
  the full head_size, matching the core INT4 page budget.
- Write newly decoded K/V tokens in the DecodeOnly path so later decode
  steps attend to up-to-date cache contents.
- Add NPU tests asserting the shape contract, packed write/read roundtrip,
  and decode-append cache mutation with prefill data preserved.

Co-authored-by: Claude
Signed-off-by: SuccinctPaul <SuccinctPaul@users.noreply.github.com>
